<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#b">Niederland.</hi></head><lb/>
<div n="3" type="jArticle"><dateline><supplied>&amp;#xfffc;</supplied> <hi rendition="#b">Am&#x017F;terdam,</hi> 27 Jan.</dateline><lb/>
